{
  "manifest_version": 1,
  "type": "device",
  "name": "Ecovacs",
  "description": {
    "en": "Control Ecovacs Deebot robot vacuums and GOAT mowers: start, dock, battery, errors.",
    "fr": "Pilotez les aspirateurs Ecovacs Deebot et tondeuses GOAT : départ, base, batterie."
  },
  "version": "1.2.0",
  "docker_image": "ghcr.io/prohand/gladys-ecovacs:1.2.0",
  "gladys_version": ">=5.1.0",
  "cover_image": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/prohand/gladys-ecovacs/main/cover.png",
  "categories": ["appliances"],
  "transports": ["cloud"],
  "config_schema": [
    {
      "key": "intro",
      "type": "section",
      "label": {
        "en": "Getting started",
        "fr": "Pour commencer"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Your robots (Deebot vacuums, GOAT mowers) are reached through the Ecovacs cloud, with the account of the Ecovacs Home app: add the robots in the app first, then enter the same email, password and country here. Accounts created with Google, Apple or Facebook sign-in need a password: set one in the app (Profile, account settings). On the first connection, Ecovacs may ask to confirm Gladys as a new device: \"Send the verification code\" mails you a code, enter it in \"Confirm the device\".",
        "fr": "Vos robots (aspirateurs Deebot, tondeuses GOAT) sont joints via le cloud Ecovacs, avec le compte de l'application Ecovacs Home : ajoutez d'abord les robots dans l'application, puis saisissez ici le même e-mail, mot de passe et pays. Un compte créé avec Google, Apple ou Facebook a besoin d'un mot de passe : définissez-en un dans l'application (Profil, paramètres du compte). À la première connexion, Ecovacs peut demander de confirmer Gladys comme nouvel appareil : « Envoyer le code de vérification » vous envoie un code par e-mail, saisissez-le dans « Confirmer l'appareil »."
      },
      "links": [
        {
          "url": "https://www.ecovacs.com/global/app",
          "label": {
            "en": "Ecovacs Home app",
            "fr": "Application Ecovacs Home"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "email",
      "type": "string",
      "label": {
        "en": "Email",
        "fr": "E-mail"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "The email of your Ecovacs Home account.",
        "fr": "L'e-mail de votre compte Ecovacs Home."
      },
      "placeholder": {
        "en": "e.g. me@example.com",
        "fr": "ex. moi@exemple.fr"
      },
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "key": "password",
      "type": "secret",
      "label": {
        "en": "Password",
        "fr": "Mot de passe"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "The password of your Ecovacs Home account. Only its MD5 fingerprint is sent to Ecovacs, as the app does.",
        "fr": "Le mot de passe de votre compte Ecovacs Home. Seule son empreinte MD5 est envoyée à Ecovacs, comme le fait l'application."
      },
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "key": "country",
      "type": "select",
      "label": {
        "en": "Country of the account",
        "fr": "Pays du compte"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "The country chosen when the account was created: it decides which Ecovacs servers hold it.",
        "fr": "Le pays choisi à la création du compte : il détermine les serveurs Ecovacs qui l'hébergent."
      },
      "required": true,
      "default": "FR",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "FR",
          "label": {
            "en": "France",
            "fr": "France"
          }
        },
        {
